# Unblessed: Library `wait for` lifecycle (#1342); first blessing awaits human review.
# wait-for-lifecycle: game's Runs wait in keys. One is cancelled as a
# Request, one runs out a Timeout Block in keys, and one is discarded when
# keys is replaced, so a later key reaches only game's own Handler.

